00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:21.640
The coloration arises from particular surface materials rather than uniform iron oxides.

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:27.540
The purple hues appear when sunlight strikes regions with specific mineral mixtures at low angles.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:32.260
These observations add detail to existing maps of surface composition.

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:38.180
